(text "AEM10300 / photovoltaic / 4.05 V long-life charge" (at 20 18 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4038dd58-7ebf-5d89-bf45-aa2645846858"))
(text "Panel maximum cold Voc <= 4.3 V; SRC operating limit is 4.5 V.\nNo nominal 6 V panels. EN_STO_FT is strapped LOW.\n4.05 V preset avoids continuous custom-divider loss; do not use 4.35 V preset." (at 20 24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bb267711-998f-52d1-86a9-6573f1c72bd1"))
(text "Storage capacitance" (at 231 117 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ea353211-b380-556f-9654-d5c19441ca5f"))
(text "4 x 100uF / 10V / 1210 X5R.\nRequire >=100uF EFFECTIVE at 4.05 V\nincluding DC bias, tolerance and temperature.\nBattery supplies TX pulses directly from PACK+." (at 231 123 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ab7341ed-96be-5c7b-9f6f-3e692ecb05de"))
(text "Strap choices from AEM10300 v1.5" (at 30 188 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6a7e012a-4cc8-536d-9a7e-18b62cf8cdbe"))
(text "STO_CFG[3:0] = 0000: 4.05 V charge, 3.50 V ready, 3.00 V low status.\nR_MPP[2:0] = 100: 80% Voc. T_MPP[1:0] = 01: 4.5 s / 70.8 ms.\nEN_HP=1; high-power harvest mode. CS_IN, ZMPP and custom sense pins open.\nST_STO can rise to PACK voltage. Test pad only; no direct 3.3 V MCU connection.\nAll grounds on this page are protected PACK- / system GND." (at 30 194 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f17ea208-a774-5d37-ac57-60d7b555f68d"))
